# Lawrencium · Lr · gate 103

**Lawrencium** (Lr) is element **103** of the periodic table — a **actinide**, period 7, group f-block, f-block, solid (predicted) at standard conditions, atomic weight **[266] (most stable isotope)**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The last actinide; named for Ernest Lawrence, who built the cyclotron.

